Don't do this.

283
00:21:08,768 --> 00:21:09,902
What the heck?

284
00:21:09,969 --> 00:21:10,970
She's so loud.

285
00:21:13,205 --> 00:21:14,974
I'm sorry.

286
00:21:15,641 --> 00:21:16,642
I'm sorry.

287
00:21:45,337 --> 00:21:46,338
Be quiet.

288
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:48,841
Be quiet.

289
00:22:04,490 --> 00:22:06,125
(Whispering Water)

290
00:22:11,530 --> 00:22:12,631
Was that funny for you?

291
00:22:13,032 --> 00:22:14,433
Was it not?

292
00:22:15,434 --> 00:22:17,736
It's my fault for holding you
to human standards.

293
00:22:18,504 --> 00:22:19,505
Whatever.

294
00:22:19,939 --> 00:22:21,040
It was fun.

295
00:22:21,106 --> 00:22:22,575
So what's next?

296
00:22:23,175 --> 00:22:24,176
Wait a moment.

297
00:22:28,347 --> 00:22:29,682
Next is...

298
00:22:35,821 --> 00:22:37,556
Oh, it's fish!

299
00:22:38,123 --> 00:22:39,124
They look delicious.

300
00:22:39,992 --> 00:22:40,993
We don't eat these.

301
00:22:41,393 --> 00:22:43,362
- And...
- Hey, look at that one.

302
00:22:43,429 --> 00:22:45,197
It's super flat.

303
00:22:45,798 --> 00:22:47,233
That's a stingray.

304
00:22:47,733 --> 00:22:49,335
You know so many things.

305
00:22:49,869 --> 00:22:51,837
Has it ever occurred to you
that you don't know anything?

306
00:22:52,471 --> 00:22:54,373
That's why you're here to show me.

307
00:22:55,341 --> 00:22:57,109
- That's true, but...
- Wow, check that out!

308
00:23:32,745 --> 00:23:35,514
Hey, we have to leave now
to get to the next place.

309
00:24:02,308 --> 00:24:03,309
Did you say something?

310
00:24:05,778 --> 00:24:06,779
Never mind.

311
00:24:09,715 --> 00:24:11,216
There are penguins over there.

312
00:24:11,517 --> 00:24:13,419
Penguins? I love them!

313
00:24:13,519 --> 00:24:14,520
Let's go!

314
00:24:26,231 --> 00:24:27,299
It's bitter.

315
00:24:27,366 --> 00:24:28,801
Why do humans drink this?

316
00:24:29,268 --> 00:24:30,970
You drink it for the aroma, not the taste.

317
00:24:31,537 --> 00:24:33,105
And you wanted to try it.

318
00:24:33,339 --> 00:24:34,807
I didn't know it'd be bitter.

319
00:24:34,873 --> 00:24:35,874
Let's switch.

320
00:24:42,848 --> 00:24:43,849
What's wrong?

321
00:24:43,916 --> 00:24:45,517
It's itchy here.

322
00:24:46,752 --> 00:24:47,820
Is it a mosquito bite?

323
00:24:49,221 --> 00:24:50,222
A mosquito?

324
00:24:54,860 --> 00:24:55,861
I got it.

325
00:24:56,195 --> 00:24:57,930
Jeez, it really filled up.

326
00:25:01,066 --> 00:25:02,201
I'm jealous.

327
00:25:03,969 --> 00:25:04,970
What?

328
00:25:09,408 --> 00:25:10,442
Never mind.

329
00:25:12,077 --> 00:25:13,078
What did she say?

330
00:25:20,853 --> 00:25:22,087
- Class president.
- Yeah?

331
00:25:22,855 --> 00:25:23,856
I'm hungry.

332
00:25:25,057 --> 00:25:26,525
I was wondering when you'd say that.

333
00:25:27,292 --> 00:25:28,293
Hold on.

334
00:25:28,861 --> 00:25:33,232
I've pinned all the good restaurants
around this area, so don't worry.

335
00:25:36,268 --> 00:25:37,269
Wait a second.

336
00:25:58,023 --> 00:26:00,492
Look at you, walking around
with this stuck to you.

337
00:26:09,568 --> 00:26:10,702
What was that for?

338
00:26:11,703 --> 00:26:12,771
I can't do this anymore.

339
00:26:12,838 --> 00:26:14,907
Wait right here for a minute.

340
00:26:15,707 --> 00:26:16,875
What is it?

341
00:26:23,715 --> 00:26:24,716
Your wallet.

342
00:26:25,417 --> 00:26:26,585
- Mine?
- Yeah.

343
00:26:27,953 --> 00:26:28,954
Why?

344
00:26:29,922 --> 00:26:31,290
Thanks, I'll be right back.

345
00:26:34,927 --> 00:26:35,928
What the heck?

346
00:26:47,439 --> 00:26:49,608
- What's that for?
- Don't move.

347
00:26:53,112 --> 00:26:54,446
Why are you doing this?

348
00:26:58,250 --> 00:27:00,052
Nice. You should wear this.

349
00:27:00,352 --> 00:27:01,487
Now I'm relieved.

350
00:27:04,056 --> 00:27:05,224
(Good Quality)

351
00:27:05,290 --> 00:27:06,291
"Good quality?"

352
00:27:07,759 --> 00:27:08,961
Let's go eat.

353
00:27:10,629 --> 00:27:11,630
Pi Na Young.

354
00:27:19,071 --> 00:27:20,706
Just talk to me already.

355
00:27:23,442 --> 00:27:24,443
About what?

356
00:27:25,377 --> 00:27:26,545
The reason for all this.

357
00:27:27,546 --> 00:27:28,981
You've been acting weird all day.

358
00:27:30,215 --> 00:27:31,950
What do you mean?

359
00:27:32,017 --> 00:27:33,852
I mean, you're already weird,

360
00:27:34,453 --> 00:27:36,989
but you've been on another level
these past two days.

361
00:27:37,923 --> 00:27:39,424
Tell me what's going on.

362
00:27:46,031 --> 00:27:47,166
If I do,

363
00:27:48,400 --> 00:27:49,568
will you tell me?

364
00:27:51,336 --> 00:27:52,337
What?

365
00:27:53,105 --> 00:27:55,440
Well, you always know everything.

366
00:27:58,510 --> 00:28:01,580
If I tell you what's wrong with me now,

367
00:28:03,348 --> 00:28:05,551
will you tell me the answer?

368
00:28:10,689 --> 00:28:12,257
I have no idea what you mean,

369
00:28:12,691 --> 00:28:13,792
but if you tell me,

370
00:28:14,259 --> 00:28:16,995
I might not know the answer,
but I can tell you something.

371
00:28:22,701 --> 00:28:23,702
I think...

372
00:28:30,943 --> 00:28:31,944
I think...

373
00:28:34,112 --> 00:28:35,180
You think?

374
00:28:40,886 --> 00:28:41,887
I think...

375
00:28:48,927 --> 00:28:49,962
Restroom.

376
00:28:51,129 --> 00:28:52,130
What?

377
00:28:53,799 --> 00:28:54,800
I need to use the restroom.

378
00:28:59,471 --> 00:29:00,639
Go ahead.

379
00:29:01,206 --> 00:29:02,207
I'll be back.

380
00:29:12,651 --> 00:29:14,119
Where did she even get this?

381
00:29:16,888 --> 00:29:18,290
Are you having fun?

382
00:29:18,357 --> 00:29:19,358
What?

383
00:29:27,499 --> 00:29:28,900
Were you talking to me?

384
00:29:30,369 --> 00:29:32,638
Yeah, I was.

385
00:29:34,806 --> 00:29:36,842
Jang U Ju, you're the only one here.

386
00:29:39,111 --> 00:29:40,112
Do you know me?

387
00:29:40,879 --> 00:29:43,715
To be exact, I know you
because Pi Na Young knows you.

388
00:29:44,316 --> 00:29:45,317
What?

389
00:29:51,156 --> 00:29:52,157
You...

390
00:29:53,492 --> 00:29:54,493
No way.

391
00:29:55,694 --> 00:29:58,797
You don't think Pi Na Young
is the only vampire in the world, do you?

392
00:30:01,199 --> 00:30:02,834
What's your point?

393
00:30:03,702 --> 00:30:05,771
You should push her back.

394
00:30:06,371 --> 00:30:07,372
What?

395
00:30:09,975 --> 00:30:11,877
This is what you are to her.

396
00:30:12,878 --> 00:30:14,179
Easy to suck on.

397
00:30:15,814 --> 00:30:18,317
Sweet, only to vanish in a moment.

398
00:30:20,752 --> 00:30:21,753
What is this about?

399
00:30:23,522 --> 00:30:24,556
So what?

400
00:30:26,458 --> 00:30:27,459
I just...

401
00:30:29,094 --> 00:30:31,263
I just feel sorry for you,

402
00:30:31,330 --> 00:30:33,432
all wrapped up so beautifully.

403
00:30:34,099 --> 00:30:35,200
That's why I'm telling you.

404
00:30:37,536 --> 00:30:39,971
Anyway, I warned you.

405
00:30:40,872 --> 00:30:42,341
The rest is up to you.

406
00:30:43,975 --> 00:30:44,976
Bye.

407
00:31:18,143 --> 00:31:19,144
I'm back.

408
00:31:27,018 --> 00:31:28,019
Hey.

409
00:31:28,653 --> 00:31:29,755
I knew something was off.

410
00:31:33,458 --> 00:31:35,227
Is this what you wanted
in the first place?

411
00:31:37,062 --> 00:31:38,430
- What?
- My blood.

412
00:31:40,132 --> 00:31:42,067
Is that what you wanted from the start?

413
00:31:43,201 --> 00:31:44,503
What are you saying?

414
00:31:44,569 --> 00:31:46,138
Don't pretend like you don't know.

415
00:31:50,175 --> 00:31:51,176
Unbelievable.

416
00:31:52,144 --> 00:31:53,445
I had no idea.

417
00:31:56,281 --> 00:31:57,315
It's not like that.

418
00:31:59,484 --> 00:32:00,485
Then what?

419
00:32:02,521 --> 00:32:03,989
Should I thank you
for saving me for later?

420
00:32:04,055 --> 00:32:05,056
Hey.

421
00:32:08,360 --> 00:32:10,762
Then prove it to me.

422
00:32:13,999 --> 00:32:15,000
Here.

423
00:32:16,401 --> 00:32:17,402
It's what you want.

424
00:32:21,106 --> 00:32:23,175
Why not? Isn't it what you want?

425
00:32:29,448 --> 00:32:30,449
I just...

426
00:32:32,417 --> 00:32:34,219
wanted to be with...

427
00:32:50,735 --> 00:32:51,736
So that was it.

428
00:32:53,038 --> 00:32:54,072
I was right.

429
00:32:55,407 --> 00:32:56,408
It's not.

430
00:32:56,475 --> 00:32:57,709
Then why?

431
00:32:58,310 --> 00:32:59,311
I just...

432
00:33:01,980 --> 00:33:02,981
I just...

433
00:33:29,174 --> 00:33:30,175
Are you a vampire?

434
00:33:30,475 --> 00:33:32,310
You see him as nothing but food now.

435
00:33:44,823 --> 00:33:45,991
Pi Na Young?

436
00:33:51,963 --> 00:33:53,498
I said it wasn't like that.

437
00:34:30,569 --> 00:34:33,505
(Francesca Next Door)

438
00:36:34,859 --> 00:36:36,861
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
